        "language": "english",
        "review": "Very fun game, as M83's Midnight City's music video taught us, you can't contain psychic children for long. But seriously though, it's a very concentrated albeit short (~1hr) experience but there's never a second of dead air or fluff. Really glad I picked this up today on a cozy cold Saturday. Would definitely be interested in similar works from these folks. Localization and performance were top notch too, ran fine for me in English on Debian 13 via Proton 9. The mirror puzzle was my favorite, there's a few obvious looking ways to maybe solve it, but the solution was an ah-ha for me. Good stuff Mocha Games!",
